    "attributes": {
      "locale": "en-US",
      "description": "TimerBar is a minimal, beautiful clock with a live progress bar. It is perfect for presentations, meetings, focus sessions, and any timed workflow.\n\nFeatures:\n- Set a timer by duration or end time\n- Fullscreen clock with an elegant progress bar\n- Quick start, pause, restart, and stop controls\n- Optional remaining-time display\n- Always-on display support\n- TimerBar+ customization with premium themes, fonts, and colors\n\nStay focused and stay in control with TimerBar.\n\nTerms of Use: https://asdftq.github.io/timerbar/terms.html",
      "keywords": "speech,meeting,stage,clock,presenter,countdown,practice,classroom,toastmasters,agenda,focus",
      "marketingUrl": "https://www.asdftq.com/timerbar/",
      "promotionalText": "Rehearse your next talk with a fullscreen clock, a live progress bar and named timers. Try the free online rehearsal timer on our website.",
      "supportUrl": "https://asdftq.github.io/timerbar/support.html",
      "whatsNew": "TimerBar now asks for a review after you finish three timers and open the completed-timer controls. The live timer remains uninterrupted."
    },
